        "created_at": "2024-04-23T14:07:16.933Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We soon enter the birth month.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-78\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-78\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e8f0e30642cb431fc91f2966c42fc88c50d9fcb5.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-78\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Editor’s Note #78</a></h3>\n\n  <p>It's another LIVE SHOW! Or, rather, it was. This is the recording of that live show. Show Notes: Run Time: 1:47:48 We do some goofs, tell some tales, answer letters and questions from chat — everything you've come to expect from an Editor's Note...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, May 7th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#281</span> - Writers’ Room: Akash’Bhuta becomes Akash’Thriya</li>\n<li>Tuesday, May 14th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#282</span> - Writers’ Room: A Day in the Life: Fanatic</li>\n<li>Tuesday, May 21st: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#79</span>\n</li>\n<li>Tuesday, May 28th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#283</span> - Writers’ Room: Bunker in space</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Expected recording schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Friday, May 3rd: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#281</span> - Writers’ Room: Akash’Bhuta becomes Akash’Thriya</li>\n<li>Friday, May 10th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#282</span> - Writers’ Room: A Day in the Life: Fanatic</li>\n<li>Friday, May 17th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#79</span>\n</li>\n<li>Friday, May 24th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#283</span> - Writers’ Room: Bunker in space</li>\n</ul>",
