        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-04-24T15:46:24.861Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I completely forgot to re-listen to it yesterday!</p>\n<p>I tell ya, turning 40 was just fine. It wasn’t until 3 months later that my body started to break down and utterly betray me! :’)</p>\n<p>Stop giving Adam existential crises! XD</p>\n<p>I have to imagine that was not <em>the</em> Dr. Fate, or it would have been signed Schmoctor Schmate.</p>\n<p>The Parse questions were so weird… There was some extra back and forth cut from the final episode, but I don’t think the guys ever got on the same page as the asker re: which images were actually being talked about. I certainly didn’t!</p>\n<p>I, for one, welcome our new Joeverlord. :V</p>\n<p>I really have to know if Lethal Kontest was spelled with a K.</p>\n<p>I hope the Wraith musical includes a number about how criminals are a superstitious, cowardly lot. V:</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2024-04-24T15:46:24.861Z",
        "reply_count": 1,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
