        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I completely forgot to re-listen to it yesterday!\n\nI tell ya, turning 40 was just fine. It wasn't until 3 months later that my body started to break down and utterly betray me! :')\n\nStop giving Adam existential crises! XD\n\nI have to imagine that was not *the* Dr. Fate, or it would have been signed Schmoctor Schmate.\n\nThe Parse questions were so weird... There was some extra back and forth cut from the final episode, but I don't think the guys ever got on the same page as the asker re: which images were actually being talked about. I certainly didn't!\n\nI, for one, welcome our new Joeverlord. :V\n\nI really have to know if Lethal Kontest was spelled with a K.\n\nI hope the Wraith musical includes a number about how criminals are a superstitious, cowardly lot. V:",
